Add operator== to the graph geometry types

The newer vector_indexing_suite from Boost.Python implements count() with
std::count(), which requires operator== for the element type. Exposing
std::vector<pinocchio::graph::Geometry> in the python bindings fails to build:

predefined_ops.h:81:24: error: no match for call to '(__gnu_cxx::__ops::_Comp_with_val<std::equal_to<void>, pinocchio::graph::Geometry, true>::_Fn) (pinocchio::graph::Geometry&, const pinocchio::graph::Geometry&)'

